      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "houshou marine (summer)",
      "excerpt": "The 4th [[official alternate costume|costume]] of [[hololive]]'s [[Houshou Marine]]. \r\n\r\nIt consists of a [[red bikini|red]] [[string bikini]] [[halterneck]] [[bikini under clothes|worn under]] a [[black jacket|black]], [[partially unzipped]] [[hooded jacket]] [[white shorts|white]] [[short shorts|short]] [[dolphin shorts]], an [[o-ring thigh strap]], an [[ankle strap]] [[gladiator sandals]], a [[black hat|black]] [[baseball cap]] and [[heart-shaped eyewear|heart-shaped]] [[sunglasses]]. A week after her third outfit debut, Marine revealed a variant with unzipped jacket, a [[wet]] [[see-through shirt|see-through]] [[cropped shirt|cropped]] [[white shirt|white]] [[t-shirt]]. This was actually a compromise to comply with YouTube's guidelines.\r\n\r\nShe has 3 different [[official alternate hairstyle|official hairstyles]] in this costume:\r\n\r\n* [[Very long hair]] tied in a [[high ponytail]]\r\n* Very long hair tied in [[twintails]] held with [[black ribbon|black]] [[hair ribbon]]s\r\n* Very long [[straight hair]] with [[sidelocks]]\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !asset #24717613: Profile\r\n* !post #4671230: Reference sheet (1)\r\n* !post #4671232: Reference sheet (2)",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    },
    {
